{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_042_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6138ad75f7b33c97d3ffa0be4ad63ba19c4ec1418830577f29943523923fa76a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37e269baad8ad6c27aeae2adeb09924e6d728fa1f802a74a05c787304e3d9cb7",
      "text": "这次录制大获成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b1770605a067a0042c6fd7ee31c131282f7f6944802e394066f115645f5379",
      "text": "是的！最重要的是，老鼠出来时大吾先生\n平安无事真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66d10c44d61b0dac699ce847a459be2890ce4859ca1b0092e0708529d239618b",
      "text": "哇哈哈。还真是这样呢——。\n让Boss操心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66bf3f840f6dd28596c0418eaeb6f194c1704713e8201b063f088022d076fcf3",
      "text": "确实很担心。但我深信，只要是大吾先生\n就一定能够顺利完成的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be6944a90d52e770da9b193d7ff9b05d6a3dd75a8982833848ca6e7b63fc4832",
      "text": "而且，今天的工作实际上也圆满成功了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f118c3754da07c6ee00f81d29625642a1bc2b54cdc7feb83443fe0701b77873",
      "text": "虽然俺之前没说，但外景前看到仓库时，\n俺就知道这地方肯定会有那玩意儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d7fd4b3d9fa27d140b8acc7ac332bd12b7f77bec9a87e236d2946b4b6df3f30",
      "text": "但是，有Boss陪着俺。\n不管发生什么都没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:078de7454b2f2fbc653e3a27f0f30365c4419b808dfaa5374fd42c5661ac13d6",
      "text": "只要这么一想，平时害怕老鼠的\n念头就淡化了不少呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9e298e9c5ad4ca9ed341bd7abf616ed53d0afcdf5535fef2e9000a6f3e39a32",
      "text": "如果我能帮上忙的话，那就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f104af0281f562b8b67d3493dfd71070d3cc0ed3d2b7c5852c1227fe034308f4",
      "text": "嗯！谢啦，Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
